                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c7d52bc4-5865-30cc-8fd5-73240a2a0c23",
                        "entry_id": "bec9d888-b578-3a4d-a5e1-2c391886ceda",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Furcht vor langen Wörtern"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "humorous"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "300c3715-63d5-41fd-89e6-1644f4e23fb5",
                                "sense_id": "c7d52bc4-5865-30cc-8fd5-73240a2a0c23",
                                "text": "„Oder man spricht einfach den Namen der Wort-Angst-Krankheit aus. Irgendein grausamer Psychologe hat sich dafür das 36-Buchstaben-Ungetüm, den Begriff Hippopotomonstrosesquippedaliophobie, ausgedacht. Wie gemein.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8dc79790-0b7c-4d74-8059-404c57ce994f",
                                "sense_id": "c7d52bc4-5865-30cc-8fd5-73240a2a0c23",
                                "text": "„Der Humor und die Gelassenheit zogen sich auch durch seinen bebilderten Vortrag, wo er Krankheiten wie die Angst vor langen Wörtern (Hippopotomonstrosesquippedaliophobie) vorstellte.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6571ea43-f663-467a-83cb-6fb57fc5b65c",
                                "sense_id": "c7d52bc4-5865-30cc-8fd5-73240a2a0c23",
                                "text": "„Das zweitlängste Wort, Hippopotomonstrosesquippedaliophobie, hat nur 36 Buchstaben. Rate mal, was es bedeutet? Angst vor langen Wörtern!“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f49e3d63-991d-44ae-b849-db467781ed22",
                                "sense_id": "c7d52bc4-5865-30cc-8fd5-73240a2a0c23",
                                "text": "„Dann gibt es noch die sogenannte Hippopotomonstrosesquippedaliophobie. Dieser Begriff bezeichnet wiederum die Angst vor sehr, sehr langen Wörtern.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e251bd9e-ec8a-4d33-a01e-f3f48e4abd5b",
                                "sense_id": "c7d52bc4-5865-30cc-8fd5-73240a2a0c23",
                                "text": "„Kennen Sie Leute, die unter Pentheraphobie leiden, der Angst vor der Schwiegermutter? Oder gar unter Hippopotomonstrosesquippedaliophobie, der Angst vor langen Wörtern?“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d568439c-37d4-49fb-b8fc-8d2ffe2b80d9",
                        "source_entry_id": "bec9d888-b578-3a4d-a5e1-2c391886ceda",
                        "source_sense_id": "c7d52bc4-5865-30cc-8fd5-73240a2a0c23",
                        "source_sense_description": "Furcht vor langen Wörtern",
                        "target_lang_word": "hippopotomonstrosesquipedaliophobia",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hippopotomonstrosesquipedaliophobia",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b8c5dcfd-8123-3109-b18a-500bd0bb34ab",
                                        "entry_id": "ecc5ae9b-09c5-3a42-90a6-a9905c52c0ee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fear of long words."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "humorous",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1137a8ff-32b3-41df-997a-0c632adc4117",
                                                "sense_id": "b8c5dcfd-8123-3109-b18a-500bd0bb34ab",
                                                "text": "Ben suffers from hippopotomonstrosesquipedaliophobia, so he seldom uses words of more than three syllables."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80fbaf01-20e2-41a9-b5f9-b1a5301e4352",
                                                "sense_id": "b8c5dcfd-8123-3109-b18a-500bd0bb34ab",
                                                "text": "However, we assume that despite the best endeavours of science, some phobias will always remain. These include paraskavedekatriaphobia, or fear of Friday the 13th. And hippopotomonstrosesquipedaliophobia, which is fear of long words."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c73f5ef4-ebc0-4e24-92ea-c9b52900d836",
                                                "sense_id": "b8c5dcfd-8123-3109-b18a-500bd0bb34ab",
                                                "text": "Those who find this column troubling are suffering from hippopotomonstrosesquippedaliophobia—the fear of long words. Or, more likely, rupophobia—a fear of rubbish."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bab2071c-c31c-46b7-8624-58d6464ab842",
                                                "sense_id": "b8c5dcfd-8123-3109-b18a-500bd0bb34ab",
                                                "text": "Coincidentally there is a masochistic PCP with hippopotomonstrosesquippedaliophobia (fear of long words) curled up in an alleyway across the street. He has been whispering “Antidisestablishmentarianism” to himself over and over for two days now, experiencing up to one orgasm every three hours as a result of The Pain […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f5544d05-6853-49eb-9d84-3987afb75ea3",
                        "source_entry_id": "bec9d888-b578-3a4d-a5e1-2c391886ceda",
                        "source_sense_id": "c7d52bc4-5865-30cc-8fd5-73240a2a0c23",
                        "source_sense_description": "Furcht vor langen Wörtern",
                        "target_lang_word": "hippopotomonstrosesquippedaliophobie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hippopotomonstrosesquippedaliophobie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8054bde6-1f15-30cb-a897-b90ea984b65e",
                                        "entry_id": "956b1b50-88da-3446-aa2e-3fead008c42f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Peur des mots trop longs, qui sont constitués de trop de syllabes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Par plaisanterie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93cfb7ac-60ce-450d-ac25-17c68981555a",
                                                "sense_id": "8054bde6-1f15-30cb-a897-b90ea984b65e",
                                                "text": "Votre Phobie : L’hippopotomonstrosesquippedaliophobie (j’ai souffert en l’écrivant)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b194959-4f55-4a7a-936c-e63216c31d05",
                                                "sense_id": "8054bde6-1f15-30cb-a897-b90ea984b65e",
                                                "text": "Je souffre d’hippopotomonstrosesquippedaliophobie et d'Hexakosioihexekontahexaphobie…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7a4d847-4a3c-474a-a35c-3e722ca32ab9",
                                                "sense_id": "8054bde6-1f15-30cb-a897-b90ea984b65e",
                                                "text": "Ceux qui trouvent que l’hippopotomonstrosesquippedaliophobie est paradoxale"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86e623bc-a1c3-47e5-8178-5653eb190a19",
                                                "sense_id": "8054bde6-1f15-30cb-a897-b90ea984b65e",
                                                "text": "Dans la catégorie « Paradoxe », l’oscar du mot le plus long est attribué à Hippopotomonstrosesquippedaliophobie que l’on retrouve chez les Anglais, les Espagnols et les Allemands. Cela signifie… « la peur de prononcer des mots trop longs »."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
